{"task_id": "Mbpp/138", "solution": "def is_Sum_Of_Powers_Of_Two(n: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if a given number can be represented as a sum of distinct powers of 2 with exponent >= 1.\n    This means 2^0 (which is 1) is not allowed.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n <= 0:\n        return False\n    # If the least significant bit is 1, it means 2^0 is needed, which is disallowed.\n    if n & 1:\n        return False\n    # For positive even numbers, any set bits above LSB correspond to allowed powers (2^k, k>=1).\n    return (n & ~1) != 0"}
