{"task_id": "Mbpp/398", "solution": "def sum_of_digits(numbers):\n    \"\"\"\n    Computes the sum of digits for each number in a list and returns the total sum.\n    Handles negative numbers by taking their absolute value.\n    \"\"\"\n    total_sum = 0\n    for num in numbers:\n        n = abs(num)\n        if n == 0:\n            total_sum += 0\n            continue\n\n        current_num_sum = 0\n        while n > 0:\n            current_num_sum += n % 10\n            n //= 10\n        total_sum += current_num_sum\n    return total_sum"}
