{"task_id": "Mbpp/626", "solution": "def triangle_area(radius: float) -> float | None:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the area of the largest triangle inscribed in a semicircle.\n    Returns None if the radius is not a positive number.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(radius, (int, float)) or radius <= 0:\n        return None\n\n    # The largest triangle inscribed in a semicircle has an area of R^2.\n    # This occurs when the triangle is an isosceles right triangle with hypotenuse = diameter (2R).\n    area = float(radius * radius)\n    return area"}
