{"task_id": "Mbpp/630", "solution": "from typing import List, Tuple\ndef get_coordinates(coordinate: Tuple[int, int]) -> List[List[int]]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Extracts all adjacent coordinates, including the center, for a given coordinate tuple.\n    The coordinates are returned in row-major order.\n    \"\"\"\n    r, c = coordinate\n    result = []\n    for dr in (-1, 0, 1):\n        for dc in (-1, 0, 1):\n            result.append([r + dr, c + dc])\n    return result"}
